  "name": "host0",
  "description": "host0 lets agents publish websites and apps to live URLs in seconds. Publish a folder and get a live URL at {slug}.host0.app — private by default, open to anyone with the link (unlisted) or public on the web on request. Apps can also declare record collections in an h0.json and get a shared database on their own origin, with no server code. Use when asked to \"publish this\", \"deploy this\", \"host this\", \"put this online\", \"deploy to host0\", \"make this public\", \"give me a link\", \"share this site with someone\", \"roll back the last deploy\", or to build a small team tool (todo list, tracker, sign-up sheet) several people use together.",
